     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><div><div>Thanks Marteen!!<br><br></div>But I am not getting the proper out format. I have written:: <b>expand.grid(h=c(60,80), w=c(100,300),sex=c(&quot;Male&quot;,&quot;Female&quot;))</b> in my script.R file and I am getting the output:: <b>list(h = c(60, 80, 60, 80, 60,... 8 elements total), w = c(100, 100, 300, 300, 100,... 8 elements total), sex = c(1L, 1L, 1L, 1L, 2L...8 elements total))</b><br>\r\n<br></div>As, you can see this is not the correct format. I am getting different format when I use renjin shell.<br><br></div>So, Please help me out with this.<br><br></div>Thanks!!<br><div><div><div><br></div></div></div>\r\n</div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Sun, Mar 16, 2014 at 2:56 PM,  <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">renji...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div style=\"font-family:arial;font-weight:bold;color:#222222;padding:0px\"> \r\n  <a name=\"m_676758181604489118_144ca3712eab8904_digest_top\" style=\"color:#222222\" rel=\"nofollow\">Today&#39;s Topic Summary</a></div>\r\n<p>Group: <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/renjin-dev/topics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/renjin-dev/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793344230465000&amp;usg=AOvVaw24w2ROPGHnJsfrKcZbiLae\">http://groups.google.com/group/renjin-dev/topics</a></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:3px;padding-left:0px\">\r\n<li style=\"color:#555555\" type=\"square\"><a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_676758181604489118_144ca3712eab8904_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\">Regarding Renjin</a> [1 Update]</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_676758181604489118_144ca3712eab8904_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\"></